es All Stars at Newport\">The Coleman Hawkins, Roy Eldridge, Pete Brown, Jo Jones All Stars at Newport</a></i> (1957)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Genius_of_Coleman_Hawkins\" title=\"The Genius of Coleman Hawkins\">The Genius of Coleman Hawkins</a></i> (1957)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hawk_Flies_High\" title=\"The Hawk Flies High\">The Hawk Flies High</a></i> (1957)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Bean_Bags\" title=\"Bean Bags\">Bean Bags</a></i> (and <a href=\"/wiki/Milt_Jackson\" title=\"Milt Jackson\">Milt Jackson</a>, 1958)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Coleman_Hawkins_and_Confr%C3%A8res\" title=\"Coleman Hawkins and Confrères\">Coleman Hawkins and Confrères</a></i> (1958)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_(Coleman_Hawkins_album)\" title=\"Soul (Coleman Hawkins album)\">Soul</a></i> (1958)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_High_and_Mighty_Hawk\" title=\"The High and Mighty Hawk\">The High and Mighty Hawk</a></i> (1958)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Saxophone_Section\" title=\"The Saxophone Section\">The Saxophone Section</a></i> (1958)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Coleman_Hawkins_with_the_Red_Garland_Trio\" title=\"Coleman Hawkins with the Red Garland Trio\">Coleman Hawkins with the Red Garland Trio</a></i> (1959)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Hawk_Eyes_(album)\" title=\"Hawk Eyes (album)\">Hawk Eyes</a></i> (1959)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Coleman_Hawkins_All_Stars\" title=\"Coleman Hawkins All Stars\">Coleman Hawkins All Stars</a></i> (with <a href=\"/wiki/Vic_Dickenson\" title=\"Vic Dickenson\">Vic Dickenson</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas_(trumpeter)\" title=\"Joe Thomas (trumpeter)\">Joe Thomas</a>, 1959)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Very_Saxy\" title=\"Very Saxy\">Very Saxy</a></i> (and <a href=\"/wiki/Eddie_%22Lockjaw%22_Davis\" title=\"Eddie &quot;Lockjaw&quot; Davis\">Eddie \"Lockjaw\" Davis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Buddy_Tate\" title=\"Buddy Tate\">Buddy Tate</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Arnett_Cobb\" title=\"Arnett Cobb\">Arnett Cobb</a>, 1959)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/At_Ease_with_Coleman_Hawkins\" title=\"At Ease with Coleman Hawkins\">At Ease with Coleman Hawkins</a></i> (1960)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Coleman_Hawkins_and_His_Orchestra\" title=\"Coleman Hawkins and His Orchestra\">Coleman Hawkins and His Orchestra</a></i> (1960)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Night_Hawk_(album)\" title=\"Night Hawk (album)\">Night Hawk</a></i> (and Eddie \"Lockjaw\" Davis, 1960)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hawk_Swings\" title=\"The Hawk Swings\">The Hawk Swings</a></i> (1960)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz_Reunion\" title=\"Jazz Reunion\">Jazz Reunion</a></i> (and Pee Wee Russell, 1961)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hawk_Relaxes\" title=\"The Hawk Relaxes\">The Hawk Relaxes</a></i> (1961)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Back_in_Bean%27s_Bag\" title=\"Back in Bean&#39;s Bag\">Back in Bean's Bag</a></i> (and <a href=\"/wiki/Clark_Terry\" title=\"Clark Terry\">Clark Terry</a>, 1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Bluesy_Burrell\" title=\"Bluesy Burrell\">Bluesy Burrell</a></i> (with <a href=\"/wiki/Kenny_Burrell\" title=\"Kenny Burrell\">Kenny Burrell</a>, 1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Coleman_Hawkins_Plays_Make_Someone_Happy_from_Do_Re_Mi\" title=\"Coleman Hawkins Plays Make Someone Happy from Do Re Mi\">Coleman Hawkins Plays Make Someone Happy from Do Re Mi</a></i> (1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Desafinado_(album)\" title=\"Desafinado (album)\">Desafinado</a></i> (1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ellington_Meets_Coleman_Hawkins\" title=\"Duke Ellington Meets Coleman Hawkins\">Duke Ellington Meets Coleman Hawkins</a></i> (1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Good_Old_Broadway\" title=\"Good Old Broadway\">Good Old Broadway</a></i> (1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Hawkins!_Alive!_At_the_Village_Gate\" title=\"Hawkins! Alive! At the Village Gate\">Hawkins! Alive! At the Village Gate</a></i> (1962)</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Hawkins!_Eldridge!_Hodges!_Alive!_At_the_Village_Gate!\" title=\"Hawkins!